    {
      "text": "Benjamin … sent not with his brethren … Lest … mischief befall him, Gen. 42:4. knowest the people … they are set on mischief, Ex. 32:22. conceived mischief, and brought forth falsehood, Ps. 7:14. speak peace … but mischief is in their hearts, Ps. 28:3. He deviseth mischief upon his bed, Ps. 36:4. iniquity … which frameth mischief by a law, Ps. 94:20. It is as sport to a fool to do mischief, Prov. 10:23. he that seeketh mischief, it shall come unto him, Prov. 11:27. their heart studieth destruction … their lips talk of mischief, Prov. 24:2. they conceive mischief, and bring forth iniquity, Isa. 59:4. Mischief shall come upon mischief, Ezek. 7:26.",
